- id: '1743483971322'
  alias: Verlichting Schuur
  description: Verlichting in de schuur aanzetten bij beweging en laag lichtniveau. Uitzetten wanneer
    er 5 min geen beweging is gedetecteerd
  triggers:
  - trigger: state
    entity_id:
    - binary_sensor.multisensor_motion_detection
    from: 'off'
    to: 'on'
  conditions:
  - condition: numeric_state
    entity_id: sensor.multisensor_illuminance
    below: 100
  actions:
  - action: switch.turn_on
    target:
      entity_id: switch.verlichting_schuur
  - wait_for_trigger:
    - entity_id: binary_sensor.multisensor_motion_detection
      to: 'off'
      for: 00:05:00
      trigger: state
  - action: switch.turn_off
    target:
      entity_id: switch.verlichting_schuur
  mode: restart
